DEFINATION ::==>  UNION combines the result of multiple queries and removes duplicate rows, whereas
 UNION ALL combines the results without removing duplicates.
 UNION ALL is generally faster because it doesn't perform duplicate elimination.

UNION ===>  Duplicate records hata deta hai.
UNION ko duplicate remove karne ke liye additional processing karni padti hai.

